## Run

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
{{#if devRequirementsTxt}}
pip install -r dev-requirements.txt
{{/if}}

cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d
{{/if}}
uvicorn src.main:create_app --reload --factory --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

