## Structure

```
src/
├── main.py                                 <- uvicorn entry point
├── app.py                                   <- FastAPI app factory
├── config/settings.py                       <- env loading
├── errors/app_error.py                      <- error classes
├── shared/
│   ├── database/<orm>.py                    <- ORM setup
│   ├── cache/redis_client.py                <- Redis client
│   ├── auth/auth_dependency.py              <- JWT auth
│   └── health/health_router.py              <- health check
├── domain/<module>/
│   ├── entity.py                            <- domain entity (pure Python)
│   ├── repository.py                        <- repository interface (ABC)
│   └── service.py                           <- domain service
├── application/<module>/
│   ├── use_case.py                          <- use cases (commands & queries)
│   └── dto.py                               <- DTOs for boundary crossing
└── infrastructure/
    ├── persistence/<module>_repository.py   <- persistence adapter
    └── web/<module>_router.py               <- FastAPI router
```

Call direction: `infrastructure -> application -> domain`. Domain never imports
from infrastructure or application.

